    Start[/Transcription Termination/] --> A1{Which termination signal?}
    
    A1 -->|Intrinsic terminator sequence| A2[Rho-independent pathway]
    A1 -->|Rho utilization rut site| A3[Rho-dependent pathway]
    
    A2 --> A4[RNAP transcribes GC-rich palindrome]
    A4 --> A5[Nascent RNA forms hairpin structure]
    A5 --> A6[Hairpin has stem 7-20 bp GC-rich and loop 3-10 nt]
    
    A6 --> A7[Hairpin forms in RNAP exit channel]
    A7 --> A8[Hairpin pulls RNA 5' direction]
    
    A8 --> A9[RNAP transcribes U-rich tract 7-9 Us]
    A9 --> A10[Weak rU-dA base pairs in RNA-DNA hybrid]
    
    A10 --> A11{Hairpin + U-tract combined effect}
    A11 -->|Yes - sufficient| A12[RNA-DNA hybrid destabilized]
    A11 -->|Weak signal| A13[Partial pausing - may read through]
    
    A12 --> A14[RNAP enters paused state]
    A14 --> A15[/Forward translocation blocked by hairpin/]
    A15 --> A16[Weak U-tract allows RNA fraying]
    
    A16 --> A17[RNA-DNA hybrid collapses]
    A17 --> A18[RNA transcript released]
    A18 --> A19[RNAP dissociates from DNA]
    
    A19 --> A20[Free RNAP for recycling]
    A18 --> A21[/Transcript with 3' end defined by terminator/]
    
    A13 --> A22{Antitermination factors present?}
    A22 -->|NusA N protein etc| A23[/Read-through - termination suppressed/]
    A22 -->|No factors| A24[/Eventually terminates/]
    A24 --> A12
    
    A3 --> A25[RNAP transcribes past rut site]
    A25 --> A26["rut site: C-rich poorly structured ~70 nt"]
    A26 --> A27[Nascent RNA emerges from RNAP]
    
    A27 --> A28{Is rut site accessible?}
    A28 -->|Yes - uncoupled transcription| A29[Rho can bind rut]
    A28 -->|No - coupled translation| A30[Ribosome covers rut site]
    
    A30 --> A31[Transcription-translation coupling]
    A31 --> A32[/No Rho-dependent termination - read through/]
    
    A29 --> A33{Rho hexamer available?}
    A33 -->|Yes| A34[Rho hexamer binds rut site on RNA]
    A33 -->|No| Wait1[Wait for Rho]
    Wait1 --> A33
    
    A34 --> A35[Rho hexamer encircles RNA in central channel]
    A35 --> A36[Rho binds ATP]
    
    A36 --> A37{ATP available?}
    A37 -->|Yes| A38[ATP binding activates Rho helicase]
    A37 -->|No| Wait2[Wait for ATP]
    Wait2 --> A37
    
    A38 --> A39[Rho translocates 5' to 3' on RNA]
    A39 --> A40[ATP hydrolysis powers translocation ~80 nt/sec]
    
    A40 --> A41{Does Rho catch paused RNAP?}
    A41 -->|Yes - RNAP paused at pause site| A42[Rho reaches RNAP]
    A41 -->|RNAP too fast| A43[/Rho dissociates - termination fails/]
    
    A42 --> A44[Rho contacts RNAP]
    A44 --> A45[Rho helicase activity disrupts RNA-DNA hybrid]
    A45 --> A46[Forward translocation of unwinding]
    A46 --> A47[RNA-DNA hybrid melted]
    
    A47 --> A48[RNA transcript released]
    A48 --> A49[RNAP dissociates]
    
    A49 --> A50[Rho-ATP hydrolysis continues]
    A50 --> A51[Rho dissociates from RNA]
    A51 --> A52[Rho recycled for next cycle]
    
    A49 --> A53[Free RNAP for recycling]
    A48 --> A54[Transcript with Rho-defined 3' end]
    
    A20 --> A55[RNAP recycling pathway]
    A53 --> A55
    
    A55 --> A56[Sigma factor may rebind]
    A56 --> A57[RNAP ready for new initiation]
    
    A21 --> End1[/Completed intrinsic termination/]
    A54 --> End2[/Completed Rho-dependent termination/]
    A57 --> End3([RNAP recycled])
    A32 --> End4[/Read-through - no termination/]
    A43 --> End4
    A23 --> End4
    

